id: CTB-SRC0010-r6
source: SRC-0010
section: §22
kind: requirement
text: By rule R6, owner-reserved decisions (financial policy, release, scope, irreversible data actions, security exceptions and architecture changes) are governed and never guessed: an owner-reserved change needs a recorded decision with its approval, and the gate enforces it. The platform must discover, classify, validate, extend, compose, supersede, relate, version and propagate changes automatically wherever safe and deterministic.
